244
00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:21.834
You money to them.

245
00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.158
Unless word spread you run off.

246
00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:26.399
Then you damaged goods.

247
00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:29.150
