<i>♪ Wade in the water, children ♪</i>

1464
01:55:19.360 --> 01:55:23.718
<i>♪ Wade in the water ♪</i>

1465
01:55:26.760 --> 01:55:29.434
<i>♪ God is gonna trouble ♪</i>

1466
